patterns with no backreference, go regexp:
  ^(a+)+$                  120 a's then '!'       no match
  ^(a+)+$                  1000000 a's then '!'   no match
  ^(a|a)*$                 1000000 a's then '!'   no match
  ^(\s*|\t)+$              1000000 spaces, '!'    no match
  ^(\w+\s?)*$              1000000 a's then '!'   no match
  ^([a-z]{2,4})+$          1000000 a's then '!'   no match
  the email regex          a@a. then a megabyte   no match

the fixes the other engines need, handed to RE2:
  ^(?>a+)+$                error parsing regexp: invalid or unsupported Perl syntax: `(?>`
  ^(a++)+$                 error parsing regexp: invalid nested repetition operator: `++`
